    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready for an exciting race in <i>Jampa Buggys</i>, a local multiplayer racing game inspired by the tropical landscapes of Para\u00edba, Brazil.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704690/extras/a67d735a196268ae5c24386afcd3f070.avif?t=1753136034\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> <br><br>Feel the adrenaline as you speed through golden beaches, sand dunes, and towering cliffs in a dynamic setting that celebrates the vibrant culture of the Northeast.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jampa Buggys blends accessible and thrilling action for players of all ages, featuring intuitive controls and amazing tracks that create fresh challenges at every race. With a vibrant visual style and a soundtrack composed by local artists, the game delivers a unique and immersive experience full of energy and authenticity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704690/extras/9f61c7b6918153961955736385668d24.avif?t=1753136034\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><br>Race side by side with friends, discover local curiosities along the tracks, and create unforgettable moments of fun in breathtaking natural and cultural environments.<br><br>Experience the true spirit of adventure as you race across breathtaking tropical landscapes. Jampa Buggys is more than just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a celebration of friendship, culture, and the joy of discovery. Every turn, every jump, and every victory brings you closer to the heart of Brazil\u2019s vibrant Northeast, creating memories that will stay with you long after the race is over.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704690/extras/5d781b025a9d6ab7716067cade74dd35.avif?t=1753136034\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer racing for up to 2 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracks inspired by real-world locations from Para\u00edba, Brazil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack featuring local Brazilian artists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-learn controls, hard-to-put-down gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual racing experience perfect for friends and family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704690/extras/517ed30641cd05ce05234c500e032144.avif?t=1753136034\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to feel the thrill of the tropics? Grab your friends, start your engines, and dive into the unforgettable world of Jampa Buggys. Race, explore, and celebrate \u2014 the adventure awaits!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready for an exciting race in <i>Jampa Buggys</i>, a local multiplayer racing game inspired by the tropical landscapes of Para\u00edba, Brazil.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704690/extras/a67d735a196268ae5c24386afcd3f070.avif?t=1753136034\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> <br><br>Feel the adrenaline as you speed through golden beaches, sand dunes, and towering cliffs in a dynamic setting that celebrates the vibrant culture of the Northeast.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jampa Buggys blends accessible and thrilling action for players of all ages, featuring intuitive controls and amazing tracks that create fresh challenges at every race. With a vibrant visual style and a soundtrack composed by local artists, the game delivers a unique and immersive experience full of energy and authenticity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704690/extras/9f61c7b6918153961955736385668d24.avif?t=1753136034\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><br>Race side by side with friends, discover local curiosities along the tracks, and create unforgettable moments of fun in breathtaking natural and cultural environments.<br><br>Experience the true spirit of adventure as you race across breathtaking tropical landscapes. Jampa Buggys is more than just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a celebration of friendship, culture, and the joy of discovery. Every turn, every jump, and every victory brings you closer to the heart of Brazil\u2019s vibrant Northeast, creating memories that will stay with you long after the race is over.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704690/extras/5d781b025a9d6ab7716067cade74dd35.avif?t=1753136034\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer racing for up to 2 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracks inspired by real-world locations from Para\u00edba, Brazil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack featuring local Brazilian artists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-learn controls, hard-to-put-down gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual racing experience perfect for friends and family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704690/extras/517ed30641cd05ce05234c500e032144.avif?t=1753136034\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to feel the thrill of the tropics? Grab your friends, start your engines, and dive into the unforgettable world of Jampa Buggys. Race, explore, and celebrate \u2014 the adventure awaits!</p>",
    "short_description": "Jampa Buggys is a fast-paced local multiplayer racing game set on the breathtaking beaches of Para\u00edba, Brazil. Race through thrilling tracks, face exciting challenges, and immerse yourself in the vibrant local culture! Perfect for friends and family, with simple controls and endless fun!",
